#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#7 (mes)
- "[Prince Croix]"
+ "[Príncipe Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#8 (mes)
- "Maroll's great king, Marcel Marollo VII, is very sick lately."
+ "O grande rei de Maroll, Marcel Marollo VII, anda muito doente."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#9 (mes)
- "His Majesty has declared that he will be leaving the future of Maroll to me or the 3rd prince, General Guillaume."
+ "Sua Majestade declarou que deixará o futuro de Maroll a mim ou ao 3º príncipe, o General Guillaume."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#10 (mes)
- "[Prince Croix]"
+ "[Príncipe Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#11 (mes)
- "General Guillaume may have an advantage in this battle as he is the great general of Maroll, but that doesn't automatically mean he'll win."
+ "O General Guillaume pode ter vantagem nesta batalha por ser o grande general de Maroll, mas isso não significa que vencerá."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#12 (mes)
- "I want to win this battle so that I can bring prosperity to the people of Maroll. They've suffered enough from war..."
+ "Quero vencer esta batalha para trazer prosperidade ao povo de Maroll. Eles já sofreram demais com a guerra..."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#13 (select)
- "Yes, I want to join you.:End Conversation"
+ "Sim, quero me juntar a você.:Encerrar conversa"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#14 (cutin)
- "bat_crua1"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#15 (mes)
- "[Prince Croix]"
+ "[Príncipe Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#16 (mes)
- "Thank you so much. I feel like I can win with the help of adventurers like you."
+ "Muito obrigado. Sinto que posso vencer com a ajuda de aventureiros como você."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#17 (mes)
- "Now, please go downstairs and join your comrades in sharpening their skills to fight the enemy!"
+ "Agora desça e junte-se aos seus camaradas para afiar as habilidades contra o inimigo!"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#18 (mes)
- "[Prince Croix]"
+ "[Príncipe Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#19 (mes)
- "For Maroll!"
+ "Por Maroll!"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#20 (cutin)
- "bat_crua2"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#21 (mes)
- "[Prince Croix]"
+ "[Príncipe Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#22 (mes)
- "The 3rd Prince Guillaume is the great general of Maroll."
+ "O 3º príncipe, Guillaume, é o grande general de Maroll."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#23 (mes)
- "It's a waste of time to explain to you how great a leader or warlord he is, since he commands the great military power of Maroll."
+ "É perda de tempo explicar o quanto ele é grande líder e senhor da guerra, já que comanda o grande poder militar de Maroll."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#24 (mes)
- "[Prince Croix]"
+ "[Príncipe Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#25 (mes)
- "Unfortunately, there's something he and his followers are unaware of:"
+ "Infelizmente, há algo que ele e seus seguidores desconhecem:"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#26 (mes)
- "Do the people of Maroll really want them to spend so much money on military power?"
+ "Será que o povo de Maroll quer mesmo que se gaste tanto dinheiro com poder militar?"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#27 (mes)
- "We have suffered enough from wars."
+ "Já sofremos demais com as guerras."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#28 (mes)
- "I believe weapons aren't the best way to bring prosperity to a nation."
+ "Acredito que armas não são o melhor caminho para a prosperidade de uma nação."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#29 (mes)
- "[Prince Croix]"
+ "[Príncipe Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#30 (mes)
- "I do not wish to shed blood, but I have no choice but to fight for the possibility of peace and for the sake of my people."
+ "Não desejo derramar sangue, mas não tenho escolha senão lutar pela possibilidade de paz e pelo bem do meu povo."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#31 (select)
