- "[General Guillaume]"
+ "[General Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#65 (mes)
- "The 5th Prince Croix is currently titled as the Prime Minister of Maroll."
+ "O 5º príncipe, Croix, é atualmente o primeiro-ministro de Maroll."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#66 (mes)
- "He thinks all national matters of a nation can be discussed and determined on a desk,"
+ "Ele acha que todos os assuntos de uma nação se resolvem numa escrivaninha,"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#67 (mes)
- "and believes in peaceful co-existence with other countries."
+ "e acredita na convivência pacífica com outros países."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#68 (mes)
- "[General Guillaume]"
+ "[General Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#69 (mes)
- "He's too ignorant to admit that so-called peace is built on countless lives that are sacrificed in wars while normal citizens and upper classes can live, oblivious to the horrors that allow them to live that way."
+ "É ignorante demais para admitir que a tal paz se ergue sobre incontáveis vidas sacrificadas em guerras, enquanto cidadãos comuns e as classes altas vivem alheios aos horrores que os sustentam."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#70 (mes)
- "[General Guillaume]"
+ "[General Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#71 (mes)
- "He's too naive to understand the reality...."
+ "É ingênuo demais para entender a realidade...."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#72 (mes)
- "I can't leave Maroll to someone like him who lives in a dream!"
+ "Não posso deixar Maroll nas mãos de alguém assim, que vive num sonho!"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#73 (mes)
- "[General Guillaume]"
+ "[General Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#74 (mes)
- "His unrealistic beliefs will drown this country in poverty and make the people weak. If he becomes the king, Maroll will never rest from the onslaughts of other countries."
+ "As crenças irrealistas dele afundarão este país na pobreza e enfraquecerão o povo. Se ele for rei, Maroll nunca terá descanso dos ataques de outros países."
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#75 (mes)
- "I want to teach him what makes this small country so powerful and prosperous. It's military power!"
+ "Quero ensinar a ele o que torna este pequeno país tão poderoso e próspero: o poder militar!"
#: npc/battleground/bg_common.txt#76 (select)
