+ "[Oficial do Exército Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#52 (mes)
- "An elite corps is already standing by to be dispatched to the battlefield."
+ "Um corpo de elite já está a postos para ser enviado ao campo de batalha."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#53 (mes)
- "Why don't you go wait for a while? I suggest you sharpen your weapons and prepare your supplies until then."
+ "Que tal aguardar um pouco? Sugiro afiar as armas e preparar os suprimentos até lá."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#54 (mes)
- "[Croix Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#55 (mes)
- "You definitely seem to be ready for battle!"
+ "Você parece mesmo pronto para a batalha!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#56 (mes)
- "Go show the Guillaumes what fear truly means!"
+ "Mostre aos Guillaume o que é medo de verdade!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#57 (mes)
- "Today, our cry of victory shall echo all over the battlefield!"
+ "Hoje nosso grito de vitória vai ecoar por todo o campo de batalha!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#59 (mes)
- "[Croix Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#60 (mes)
- "Today, we shall be victorious!"
+ "Hoje seremos vitoriosos!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#61 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#62 (mes)
- "The objective of the Flavius Battle is to score 2 points before your enemy by destroying their crystal."
+ "O objetivo da Batalha de Flavius é marcar 2 pontos antes do inimigo destruindo o cristal dele."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#63 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#64 (mes)
- "The crystals for both armies are protected by special barricades that cannot be destroyed by direct attacks."
+ "Os cristais dos dois exércitos são protegidos por barricadas especiais que não podem ser destruídas por ataque direto."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#65 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#66 (mes)
- "But they can be removed by destroying the Guardians that protect the enemy army base."
+ "Mas elas podem ser removidas destruindo os Guardiões que protegem a base inimiga."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#67 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#68 (mes)
- "The crystals are immune to every type of skill; your physical attacks are the only choice for destroying your enemy's crystal."
+ "Os cristais são imunes a todo tipo de habilidade; o ataque físico é a única forma de destruir o cristal inimigo."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#69 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#71 (mes)
- "If you are ready, start by clicking the ^0000FFbattle button from the interface^000000."
+ "Se está pronto, comece clicando no ^0000FFbotão de batalha da interface^000000."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#72 (mes)
- "Please remember: when you join a battle, you will be receiving a token which indicates the set duration for which you cannot participate in the same type of battle."
+ "Lembre-se: ao entrar numa batalha você recebe uma marca que indica por quanto tempo não poderá participar do mesmo tipo de batalha."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#73 (mes)
- "You may check the duration by pressing the Alt+U keys."
+ "Você pode conferir o tempo apertando Alt+U."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#74 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#76 (mes)
- "Please bear in mind once you cancel, ^0000FFyou may not reapply for 1 minute^000000!"
+ "Tenha em mente que, ao cancelar, ^0000FFnão poderá se alistar de novo por 1 minuto^000000!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#77 (mes)
- "Are you ready for battle? Then apply with the recruiter next to me!"
+ "Pronto para a batalha? Então aliste-se com o recrutador ao meu lado!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#78 (mes)
- "[Croix Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#79 (mes)
