- "Are you ready for battle? Then apply with the recruiter next to me!"
+ "Pronto para a batalha? Então aliste-se com o recrutador ao meu lado!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#96 (mes)
- "- Wait a minute !! -"
+ "- Espera aí!! -"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#97 (mes)
- "- Currently you're carrying -"
+ "- Você está carregando -"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#98 (mes)
- "- too many items with you. -"
+ "- itens demais. -"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#99 (mes)
- "- Please try again -"
+ "- Tente de novo -"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#100 (mes)
- "- after you lose some weight. -"
+ "- depois de aliviar o peso. -"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#101 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#102 (mes)
- "Let's show the power of the Guillaume Army to those stinky Croixs!"
+ "Vamos mostrar o poder do Exército Guillaume a esses Croix fedorentos!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#103 (select)
- "I want to join your army!:End Conversation"
+ "Quero entrar no seu exército!:Encerrar conversa"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#104 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#105 (mes)
- "I'm very pleased that you want to join us and fight the Croix Army, but I'm sorry: I can't send a rookie like you to die on the cruel battlefield."
+ "Fico feliz que queira lutar conosco contra o Exército Croix, mas sinto muito: não posso mandar um novato como você morrer num campo de batalha cruel."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#106 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#107 (mes)
- "I'm very pleased that you want to join us and fight the Croix Army, but I'm sorry: I can't send a rookie like you to die on the cruel battlefield."
+ "Fico feliz que queira lutar conosco contra o Exército Croix, mas sinto muito: não posso mandar um novato como você morrer num campo de batalha cruel."
