- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#109 (mes)
- "You seem to have just returned from the battlefield."
+ "Parece que você acabou de voltar do campo de batalha."
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#110 (mes)
- "It's too early for you to go back. Go rest, and leave the enemies to us!"
+ "É cedo demais para você voltar. Vá descansar e deixe os inimigos conosco!"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#112 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/flavius/flavius_enter.txt#113 (mes)
