### npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt  (108 textos)
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#2 (mes)
- "[Croix Mercenary Officer]"
+ "[Recrutador do Exército Croix]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#3 (mes)
- "I know that you've already signed with the Croix. Go back and join their team. We will not accept traitors to fight for us."
+ "Sei que você já se alistou com os Croix. Volte e junte-se a eles. Não aceitamos traidores lutando por nós."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#4 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Mercenary Officer]"
+ "[Recrutador do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#5 (mes)
- "It seems you have recently participated in a KVM battle. You must wait 5 minutes before signing up again."
+ "Parece que você participou de uma batalha KVM há pouco. É preciso esperar 5 minutos para se alistar de novo."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#6 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Mercenary Officer]"
+ "[Recrutador do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#7 (mes)
- "Let them know the real might of Guillaume!"
+ "Mostre a eles a verdadeira força dos Guillaume!"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#8 (select)
- "I will fight with you.:End Conversation."
+ "Vou lutar com você.:Encerrar conversa."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#9 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Mercenary Officer]"
+ "[Recrutador do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#10 (mes)
- "Show them how strong we are."
+ "Mostre a eles o quanto somos fortes."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#11 (mes)
- "Today, everyone will hear the shout of triumph from Guillaume!"
+ "Hoje todos ouvirão o grito de triunfo dos Guillaume!"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#15 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Mercenary Officer]"
+ "[Recrutador do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#16 (mes)
- "We will win!"
+ "Nós venceremos!"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#17 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#18 (mes)
- "Hello."
+ "Olá."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#19 (mes)
- "What do you want to know?"
+ "O que você quer saber?"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#20 (select)
- "Apply for KVM.:What is KVM?:How do I participate in KVM?:I want to know my Kreiger Points."
+ "Alistar-se no KVM.:O que é o KVM?:Como participo do KVM?:Quero saber meus Pontos Kreiger."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#21 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ "[Cavaleiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#23 (mes)
