+ "[Logística]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#109 (mes)
- "Weapon rewards require 2,000 KVM points for each."
+ "As armas de recompensa custam 2.000 pontos KVM cada."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#110 (mes)
- "There are 3 types of Armor rewards and they require 840/630/580 KVM points fo each."
+ "Há 3 tipos de armadura de recompensa, a 840/630/580 pontos KVM cada."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#111 (mes)
- "Accessory rewards require 1,200 KVM points for each."
+ "Os acessórios de recompensa custam 1.200 pontos KVM cada."
