- "[Logistics]"
+ "[Logística]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#113 (mes)
- "Kreiger Weapons are LV 4 Weapons, they can be upgraded and will have special effects: Slaughter, Destruction and Blessing."
+ "As Armas Kreiger são de nível 4, podem ser refinadas e têm efeitos especiais: Massacre, Destruição e Bênção."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#114 (mes)
- "[Logistics]"
+ "[Logística]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#115 (mes)
- "When you can wear all 3 armors, you can have a special set of options."
+ "Usando as 3 armaduras, você ganha um conjunto especial de bônus."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#116 (mes)
- "Also, when Kreiger Accessory rewards are worn with medalsm it will bring you special set rewards."
+ "Além disso, usar os acessórios Kreiger junto com as medalhas concede bônus de conjunto."
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#117 (mes)
- "[Logistics]"
+ "[Logística]"
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_item_pay.txt#118 (mes)
