### npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt  (99 textos)
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#165 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Blacksmith]"
+ "[Ferreiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#166 (mes)
- "We are in urgency! The Barricade has been destroyed!"
+ "É urgente! A Barricada foi destruída!"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#167 (mes)
- "We can repair the Barricade with ^3131FF50 Stones, 3 Sinew of Bear, 500 Metal Fragments, 30 Rough Elunium and 100 Gold.^000000"
+ "Podemos reparar a Barricada com ^3131FF50 Pedras, 3 Tendões de Urso, 500 Fragmentos de Metal, 30 Eluniums Brutos e 100 de Ouro.^000000"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#168 (mes)
- "We have it all except for the 50 Stones!"
+ "Temos tudo, menos as 50 Pedras!"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#169 (select)
- "Repair.:Leave it."
+ "Reparar.:Deixar assim."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#170 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Blacksmith]"
+ "[Ferreiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#171 (mes)
- "You brought enough stones! Let's go and repair."
+ "Você trouxe pedras suficientes! Vamos reparar."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#172 (mes)
- ".."
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#173 (mes)
