#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#179 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Blacksmith]"
+ "[Ferreiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#180 (mes)
- "Combine Stones and Gold in the proper percentage."
+ "Combine Pedras e Ouro na proporção certa."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#181 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Blacksmith]"
+ "[Ferreiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#182 (mes)
- "Combine Stones and Gold in the proper percentage and shape the Barricade."
+ "Combine Pedras e Ouro na proporção certa e molde a Barricada."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#183 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Blacksmith]"
+ "[Ferreiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#184 (mes)
- "Combine Stones and Gold in the proper percentage and shape the Barricade, then add Rough Elunium to make it stronger."
+ "Combine Pedras e Ouro na proporção certa, molde a Barricada e acrescente Elunium Bruto para reforçá-la."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#185 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Blacksmith]"
+ "[Ferreiro Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#186 (mes)
- "Combine Stones and Gold in the proper percentage and shape the Barricade, then add Rough Elunium to make it stronger. Now decorate with Metal Fragments."
+ "Combine Pedras e Ouro na proporção certa, molde a Barricada e acrescente Elunium Bruto para reforçá-la. Agora decore com Fragmentos de Metal."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra01.txt#187 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Blacksmith]"
