#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#2 (mes)
- "- Wait a minute !! -"
+ "- Espera aí!! -"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#3 (mes)
- "- Currently you're carrying -"
+ "- Você está carregando -"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#4 (mes)
- "- too many items with you. -"
+ "- itens demais. -"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#5 (mes)
- "- Please try again -"
+ "- Tente de novo -"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#6 (mes)
- "- after you lose some weight. -"
+ "- depois de aliviar o peso. -"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#7 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#8 (mes)
- "Let's show the power of the Guillaume Army to those stinky Croixs!"
+ "Vamos mostrar o poder do Exército Guillaume a esses Croix fedorentos!"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#9 (select)
- "I want to join your army!:End Conversation"
+ "Quero entrar no seu exército!:Encerrar conversa"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#10 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#11 (mes)
- "I'm very pleased that you want to join us and fight the Croix Army, but I'm sorry: I can't send a rookie like you to die on the cruel battlefield."
+ "Fico feliz que queira lutar conosco contra o Exército Croix, mas sinto muito: não posso mandar um novato como você morrer num campo de batalha cruel."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#12 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#13 (mes)
- "I'm very pleased that you want to join us and fight the Croix Army, but I'm sorry: I can't send a rookie like you to die on the cruel battlefield."
+ "Fico feliz que queira lutar conosco contra o Exército Croix, mas sinto muito: não posso mandar um novato como você morrer num campo de batalha cruel."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#14 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#15 (mes)
- "You seem to have just returned from the battlefield."
+ "Parece que você acabou de voltar do campo de batalha."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#16 (mes)
- "It's too early for you to go back. Go rest, and leave the enemies to us!"
+ "É cedo demais para você voltar. Vá descansar e deixe os inimigos conosco!"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#18 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#19 (mes)
- "I've received a report informing me that an elite corps has been dispatched to the battlefield fighting the Croixs already."
+ "Recebi um relatório informando que um corpo de elite já foi enviado ao campo de batalha contra os Croix."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#20 (mes)
- "Why don't you go wait for a while? I suggest you sharpen your weapons and prepare your supplies until then."
+ "Que tal aguardar um pouco? Sugiro afiar as armas e preparar os suprimentos até lá."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#21 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#22 (mes)
- "An elite corps is already standing by to be dispatched to the battlefield."
+ "Um corpo de elite já está a postos para ser enviado ao campo de batalha."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#23 (mes)
- "Why don't you go wait for a while? I suggest you sharpen your weapons and prepare your supplies until then."
+ "Que tal aguardar um pouco? Sugiro afiar as armas e preparar os suprimentos até lá."
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#24 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#25 (mes)
- "You definitely seem to be ready for battle!"
+ "Você parece mesmo pronto para a batalha!"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#26 (mes)
- "Go show the Croixs what fear truly means!"
+ "Mostre aos Croix o que é medo de verdade!"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#27 (mes)
- "Today, our cry of victory shall echo all over the battlefield!"
+ "Hoje nosso grito de vitória vai ecoar por todo o campo de batalha!"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#29 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Army Officer]"
+ "[Oficial do Exército Guillaume]"
#: npc/battleground/tierra/tierra_enter.txt#30 (mes)
- "Today, we shall be victorious!"
+ "Hoje seremos vitoriosos!"
